@startuml
title ASII-05 - Vista de componentes dentro del HIS

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Usuario autorizado" as Usuario

package "Sistema Hospitalario Integrado" {

  component "Frontend Vue 3" as Front

  package "Middleware" {
    component "TenantMiddleware\nX-Tenant-ID" as MwTenant
    component "JwtAuth" as MwJwt
  }

  package "ASII-05 - Citas medicas y agenda" {
    component "AppointmentController\nFormRequests" as Ctrl
    component "Casos de uso\nSolicitar, Confirmar, Cancelar,\nReagendar, Consultar" as Uso
    component "Dominio\nAppointment, AppointmentStatus" as Dom
    component "Contratos\nAppointmentRepository\nDoctorAvailabilityRepository\nTenantContext" as Contratos
    component "Adaptadores Eloquent" as Infra
  }

  component "ASII-01\nUsuarios y tenants" as M01
  component "ASII-02\nRBAC" as M02
  component "ASII-03\nPacientes" as M03
  component "ASII-04\nMedicos y especialidades" as M04
}

database "PostgreSQL\nappointments\ndoctor_availabilities" as DB

Usuario --> Front
Front --> MwTenant : /api/v1
MwTenant --> MwJwt
MwJwt --> Ctrl

Ctrl --> Uso
Uso --> Dom
Uso ..> Contratos
Contratos <|.. Infra
Infra --> DB

MwTenant ..> M01 : valida tenant
MwJwt ..> M02 : permisos
Infra ..> M03 : patients
Infra ..> M04 : doctors, specialties

note bottom of Contratos
Declarados en Domain.
Infrastructure depende de ellos,
nunca al reves.
end note

note bottom of M04
La disponibilidad medica todavia no
se expone en el backend Laravel, por
lo que ASII-05 mantiene su propia
tabla tras un contrato sustituible.
end note

@enduml
